D[49470]={"^Instantly attack for (.-)%% of your main%-hand's weapon damage plus (.-)%. In addition, your Thunder Clap damage to the target is increased by (.-)%% %((.-)%% against players%)%.\n\n|cffFFFFFFCosts a Storm Blade charge%.|r%s*$","Ataca instantaneamente {{1}}% do dano da arma principal mais {{2}}. Além disso, seu dano Trovoada o alvo aumenta em {{3}}% ({{4}}% contra jogadores).\n\n|cffFFFFFFCusto: uma carga de Lâmina Tempestade.|r"}
