D[51705]={"^Blessed by the Queen, health regeneration is significantly increased, and has extra holy damage dealt on hit%.%s*$","Abençoado pela Rainha, a regeneração de vida é significativamente aumentada e causa dano Sagrado adicional ao golpear."}
